> vt: Enlarge the framebuffer glyph size from 16 to 32 bits.
>
> This allows:
>    o - More than 256/512 distinct half-width glyphs (in fact, up to 2^21).
>    o - Unicode code points >0xffff (outside the Basic Multilingual Plane).
