    Test          : sched-messaging
    Units         : Normalized time in seconds
    Interpretation: Lower is better
    Statistic     : AMean
    ==================================================================
      Test:                   vanilla                 handoff             steal + handoff
       1-groups:         3.12 (0.00 pct)         3.47 (-11.21 pct)       3.63 (-16.34 pct)  *
