Closes: https://sashiko.dev/#/patchset/20260513-exynos850-cpuhotplug-v4-0-54fec5f65362@linaro.org?part=3
Fixes: 78b72897a5c8 ("soc: samsung: exynos-pmu: Enable CPU Idle for gs101")
Cc: stable@vger.kernel.org
